==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la}} {{term|ab||from|lang=la}} + {{term|initio|initiō||lang=la}}, ablative singular of {{term|initium||beginning|lang=la}}.

===Adverb===
{{head|en|adverb|head=[[ab]] [[initio]]}}

# {{legal}} From the time when a legal document comes into force.
# {{science}} Calculated from first principles, i.e. from basic laws without any further additional assumptions.
# {{context|of an academic course}} Taken with no prior qualifications.

====Related terms====
* [[void ab initio]]

